WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.513
Good Morning Hank, it's monday.

00:00:01.513 --> 00:00:03.458
This giant squid of anger is reading my collective works.

00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:07.480
You'll never guess what came in the mail today, unless you guess it's the fault in our stars!

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:12.102
Aaaaaaah! This is the real book. One of the few unsigned copies there actually are on the back.

00:00:12.102 --> 00:00:14.815
One the back there are quotes from Marcus Zusak and Jodi Picoult and E. Lockhart.

00:00:14.815 --> 00:00:19.335
Marcus Zusak says : "The fault in our stars is John Green at his best. You laugh, you cry...

00:00:19.335 --> 00:00:20.581
...and then you come back for more."

00:00:20.581 --> 00:00:22.073
Thank you Marcus Zusak!

